From: maan2003 <manmeetmann2003@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 09:37:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] libstore: BuildEnvironment::toRcScript; C API

The script nix develop and print-dev-env source, moved from develop.cc,
so that C API users (nix_build_env_to_rc_script) apply an environment
exactly as nix develop does: interactive variables kept, PATH and
XDG_DATA_DIRS appended, fresh temporary directories, outputs redirected,
shellHook last.
---
 src/libstore-c/nix_api_build_env.cc           |  17 +++
 src/libstore-c/nix_api_build_env.h            |  26 ++++
 src/libstore/build-environment.cc             | 105 ++++++++++++++++
 .../include/nix/store/build-environment.hh    |  22 ++++
 src/nix/develop.cc                            | 112 +-----------------
 5 files changed, 176 insertions(+), 106 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/libstore-c/nix_api_build_env.cc b/src/libstore-c/nix_api_build_env.cc
index 213d9f50d..2316693e7 100644
--- a/src/libstore-c/nix_api_build_env.cc
+++ b/src/libstore-c/nix_api_build_env.cc
@@ -72,6 +72,23 @@ nix_err nix_build_env_to_bash(
     NIXC_CATCH_ERRS
 }
 
+nix_err nix_build_env_to_rc_script(
+    nix_c_context * context,
+    nix_build_env * env,
+    const char * tmp_dir,
+    const char * outputs_dir,
+    nix_get_string_callback callback,
+    void * user_data)
+{
+    if (context)
+        context->last_err_code = NIX_OK;
+    try {
+        auto script = env->env->toRcScript(tmp_dir, outputs_dir);
+        return call_nix_get_string_callback(script, callback, user_data);
+    }
+    NIXC_CATCH_ERRS
+}
+
 bool nix_build_env_has_structured_attrs(nix_build_env * env)
 {
     return env->env->providesStructuredAttrs();
